Description
                    
                    
































A marketing team is analyzing communication preferences for adopters who have chosen pets with names starting with the letters "C" or "P." Their goal is to tailor outreach efforts by understanding the contact details and preferred breeds associated with these popular pet name initials.
To support this initiative, a query is needed to retrieve the Adopter Name, Animal Breed, and Adopter Phone Number for all adoptions where the adopted animal's name begins with either "C" or "P."
This data will help the team target communications more effectively and personalize messaging based on adopter preferences and the types of animals they have adopted. The results are ordered alphabetically by adopter name in descending order.



The result should have the following columns:full_namebreedphone




full_name- name of the adopterbreed- breed name of the animalphone- phone number of the adopterSort the results by full name in descending order.Rules: Include only animals whose names start with the letter 'C' or 'P'.Hint: Data is case-sensitive.
